		{"id":"f53391a104de1b4d","type":"text","text":"# Letter from Salt Brah\n\nKoko. How do you accept yourself? \n\nI shout at people because I am angry. Then People get angry too. It's cause and effect. Their effect proves that I was the cause. \n\nBut it brings all sorts of problems, people get injured or imprisoned, and it was all initiated by me.\n\nBut then I remember: I created something new. Situations that never happened before.","x":-3265,"y":-8009,"width":445,"height":469},
