		{"id":"68c8ab5a66c7893c","type":"text","text":"A renaissance woman. Speaks 12 different languages. Obsessed with art gallerys and versace. A patriarch, kind of, but with **S T Y L E**","x":-9923,"y":-4637,"width":327,"height":250},
