		{"id":"fc8f07ed5ffa3dd6","type":"text","text":"RICH. Potential hobbies: Fame and Fortune (She throws money billd it arround like it is confetti).\n\nWhen Mia is 28 years, and Beatrix is 66 years older, then Beatrix must be like ... 74? Probably knows a lot about cosmetic surgeons...\n\nOr **cosmic** surgeons. These are surgeons who know what glittermaxxing is. \n\nHaaa <3\n\n\n\n","x":-9347,"y":-4637,"width":327,"height":250},
