		{"id":"504e6570c954ea43","type":"text","text":"**WARNING** I was SUPER drunk\n\n\"In the name of the universe, my love, and the hand of yours that I hold: we are together. And for the orchestra of the planets you created for me, my heart shall orbit you forever. You are the star that turned me into dust, and the phoenix that rose from within me— spreading its wings to carry you toward the heavens —ignites the sun inside you. And the universe agrees\"","x":-8679,"y":-9843,"width":779,"height":223}
